-- Migration: 0106_meal_recipe_sourced_calories_part1
-- Target: Cloudflare D1 (SQLite)
-- Part 1/1: for recipes whose own dish appears with a
-- "(XXX kcal)" annotation in the source's own daily-menu table (bang_dinh_duong)
-- for that dish, this is a genuine per-serving figure from the original site —
-- unlike the ingredient-sum estimate elsewhere in this dataset, which is a
-- whole-dish total (no real serving count in the source data). Where a prior
-- whole-dish estimate existed, the ratio between it and this sourced value IS
-- the dish's real serving count, so protein/fat/carb are scaled by that same
-- ratio and servings is corrected from the default 1.
